# QueueIQ — Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values for LOCAL development only.
# NEVER commit .env to git — it is already in .gitignore.
#
# PRODUCTION DEPLOYMENT:
#   Streamlit Community Cloud → Add via the "Secrets" panel in the dashboard
#   Railway / Render          → Add via the platform's environment variable UI
#   Docker                    → Pass as --env-file or via docker-compose.yml
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── SERVER-SIDE SECRETS (never expose these to the client) ───────────────────

# Groq LLM API key — used for AI narrative alert generation.
# Free tier available at https://console.groq.com/keys
# If not set, QueueIQ falls back to template-based alerts (fully functional offline).
GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here
